v Se<\/b> in 2018 to enable young talents to receive a high level of tertiary education. The university was named the Cambodia University of Technology and Science (CamTech) and receives support from the Federation of Khmer-Chinese in Cambodia with an <i>aim to cultivate Cambodian young professional talents in science and technology and enhance Cambodia&#8217;s economic development<\/i>, with technical partnership with established and reputable universities in the Asian region. In return, CamTech will equip their students with academic and hands-on training, which will increase their employability and contribute to the development of Cambodia.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19cc26e elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"19cc26e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9bfcdbb elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"9bfcdbb\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a170f50\" data-id=\"a170f50\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-431df89 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"431df89\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"451\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/\u67ec\u534e\u7406\u5de5\u5927\u5b66\u9879\u76ee\u7b80\u4ecb_EN.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-9497\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/\u67ec\u534e\u7406\u5de5\u5927\u5b66\u9879\u76ee\u7b80\u4ecb_EN.jpg 758w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/\u67ec\u534e\u7406\u5de5\u5927\u5b66\u9879\u76ee\u7b80\u4ecb_EN-300x211.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e14bf9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7e14bf9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i>During the meeting\u00a0 with\u00a0 the Founder and the\u00a0 Representative\u00a0 of\u00a0 Tianjin University of Technology, HE Dr <\/i><i>Hang Chuon Naron<\/i><i>, the <\/i><i>Minister of Education, Youth and Sport<\/i><i>, expressed his full support to the project of CamTech University.<\/i><\/p><p><br \/><br \/><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-67384b3\" data-id=\"67384b3\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9bac5e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e9bac5e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In March 2021, <b>CamTech<\/b> received the official approval from the Royal Government of Cambodia to operate with the establishment of five faculties: the Faculty of Engineering, the Faculty of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences, the Faculty of Business and Management, the Faculty of Applied Sciences, and the Faculty of Sustainable Built Environment.\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>Not-profit Status<br \/><\/strong>The University is a private not-for-profit institution with the mission of enabling young bright students from different backgrounds to be equipped with quality education and practical skills to contribute to the development of Cambodia. The University can pursue income-generating activities, as long as any surplus is reinvested back into the University, to ensure quality and sustainability.<strong><br \/><\/strong><\/p><p><b>Neak Oknha Pung Kheav Se Foundation<br \/><\/b>To contribute to the establishment of the university, Neak Oknha Pung Kheav Foundation (the Foundation) was founded. The Foundation has provided 5 hectares of land in Chroy Changva Satellite city as the campus of the CamTech University, and invested more than $3 million to build the campus with the main university building, state-of-the-art facilities, a garden and a canteen.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d47a407 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d47a407\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"632\" height=\"231\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/history-scheme.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-9499\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/history-scheme.jpg 632w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/history-scheme-300x110.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 632px) 100vw, 632px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a3ae5b7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a3ae5b7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25cbc6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"25cbc6b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>History The idea of a university was the brainchild of Neak Oknha Dr Pung Kheav Se in 2018 to enable young talents to receive a high level of tertiary education. The idea of a university was the brainchild of Neak Oknha Dr Pung Kheav Se in 2018 to enable young talents to receive a high level of tertiary education. The university was named the Cambodia University of Technology and Science (CamTech) and receives support from the Federation of Khmer-Chinese in Cambodia with an aim to cultivate Cambodian young professional talents in science and technology and enhance Cambodia&#8217;s economic development, with technical partnership with established and reputable universities in the Asian region. In return, CamTech will equip their students with academic and hands-on training, which will increase their employability and contribute to the development of Cambodia. During the meeting\u00a0 with\u00a0 the Founder and the\u00a0 Representative\u00a0 of\u00a0 Tianjin University of Technology, HE Dr Hang Chuon Naron, the Minister of Education, Youth and Sport, expressed his full support to the project of CamTech University. In March 2021, CamTech received the official approval from the Royal Government of Cambodia to operate with the establishment of five faculties: the Faculty of Engineering, the Faculty of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences, the Faculty of Business and Management, the Faculty of Applied Sciences, and the Faculty of Sustainable Built Environment.\u00a0 Not-profit StatusThe University is a private not-for-profit institution with the mission of enabling young bright students from different backgrounds to be equipped with quality education and practical skills to contribute to the development of Cambodia. The University can pursue income-generating activities, as long as any surplus is reinvested back into the University, to ensure quality and sustainability. Neak Oknha Pung Kheav Se FoundationTo contribute to the establishment of the university, Neak Oknha Pung Kheav Foundation (the Foundation) was founded. The Foundation has provided 5 hectares of land in Chroy Changva Satellite city as the campus of the CamTech University, and invested more than $3 million to build the campus with the main university building, state-of-the-art facilities, a garden and a canteen.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4130","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","post-no-thumbnail"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4130","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4130"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4130\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":35942,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/p